schema.description:
Standard API response wrapper.

All API endpoints return this format for consistency.

Success response:
    {
        "success": true,
        "data": <response data>
    }

Error response:
    {
        "success": false,
        "error": {
            "code": "ERROR_CODE",
            "message": "Human readable message",
            "details": {}
        }
    }

